  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MPMF Core Contribution 2023-24</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Montreal Protocol Multilateral Fund (MPMF) is dedicated to reversing the deterioration of the Earth&apos;s ozone layer. It was established in 1991 to assist developing countries meet their Montreal Protocol commitments. It is managed by an Executive Committee with equal membership from developed and developing countries. The Fund is replenished on a three-year basis with contributions determined according to the United Nations Scale of Assessment.</narrative>
  </description>
